flowchart TD
  A[New task] --> B[Planning]
  B --> C[Plan ready]
  C --> D{Approval required?}
  D -->|yes| E[Awaiting approval]
  E -->|approve| F[Acting]
  E -->|reject| G[Revise or cancel]
  D -->|no| F
  F --> H[Tool events]
  H --> I[Patch/checkpoint]
  I --> J[Verifying]
  J --> K{Checks pass?}
  K -->|yes| L[Delivery report]
  K -->|no| M[Repair budget]
  M -->|available| F
  M -->|exhausted| N[Failure evidence]
